SDL3_gfx - AmigaOS 68k classical Makefile
==========================================

This archive adds a traditional Makefile for the m68k-amigaos GCC toolchain.
It supports separate clib2 and libnix builds and includes all shipped tests.

Common build flags:

    -mcpu=68040 -mhard-float -O3

The following math functions are explicitly protected from GCC builtin
replacement, matching the usual AmigaOS 68k build setup:

    -fno-builtin-floor
    -fno-builtin-ceil
    -fno-builtin-sin
    -fno-builtin-cos
    -fno-builtin-log10

No builtin exceptions are added for sqrt, pow, fabs, etc.

Runtime variants
----------------

Build both clib2 and libnix variants:

    make

Build clib2 only:

    make clib2

This uses -mcrt=clib2 for compilation and executable linking.

Build libnix only:

    make libnix

This uses -noixemul for compilation and executable linking.

Requirements
------------

* SDL3 headers in the compiler's normal include path
* libSDL3.a in the compiler's normal library path
* For TestGfx, TestRotozoom and TestFramerate:
  SDL3/SDL_test_common.h and libSDL3_test.a

Outputs
-------

clib2:

    build/clib2/lib/libSDL3_gfx.a
    build/clib2/bin/TestGfx
    build/clib2/bin/TestImageFilter
    build/clib2/bin/TestRotozoom
    build/clib2/bin/TestFramerate

libnix:

    build/libnix/lib/libSDL3_gfx.a
    build/libnix/bin/TestGfx
    build/libnix/bin/TestImageFilter
    build/libnix/bin/TestRotozoom
    build/libnix/bin/TestFramerate

The BMP files required by the tests are copied to each bin directory. Run the
test programs from that directory so their sample images can be found.

If SDL3 is not installed in the default compiler paths, for example:

    make SDL3_CFLAGS="-I/path/to/include" \
         SDL3_LIBS="-L/path/to/lib -lSDL3" \
         SDL3_TEST_LIBS="-L/path/to/lib -lSDL3_test"

The shipped TestGfx.c contained duplicate declarations such as "rx, rx" and
"tx1, tx1". Those obvious source typos have been corrected in this archive.
